/-- Paper p.28, Theorem 5.6: all clauses of Definition 4.7 are retained.
Printed Eq.(85) overlaps J_1=0 with the dual +dI clause at p=0;
changed the first dual value to dI because its right-addition content is d. -/
theorem theorem_5_6 {d p q : ℕ} (hd : 2 ≤ d) :
    AdditivelyCentral d p q ∧ Separating d p q := by sorry

end

